<BaseLayout
  title="Gravity Roller Conveyors: Angles, Spacing & Selection Guide"
  description="Gravity roller conveyors. Decline angles, roller spacing rules, weight capacities, and selection criteria. Lowest cost conveyor option for cases and cartons."
